ve":false},{"id":"seg-032","text":"匍匐救之","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-033","text":"不我能慉","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-034","text":"反以我为雠","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-035","text":"既阻我德","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-036","text":"贾用不售","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-037","text":"昔育恐育鞫","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-038","text":"及尔颠覆","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-039","text":"既生既育","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-040","text":"比予于毒","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-041","text":"我有旨蓄","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-042","text":"亦以御冬","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-043","text":"宴尔新昏","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-044","text":"以我御穷","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-045","text":"有洸有溃","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-046","text":"既诒我肄","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-047","text":"不念昔者","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-048","text":"伊余来塈","isActive":false}]},"material":{"id":"wangli-yundu","title":"詩經韻讀","authors":["王力"],"contributorLine":"现代 · 王力","era":"现代","publicationYear":1980,"carrier":"PDF"},"stats":{"annotationCount":2,"glossCount":2},"annotations":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"total":2,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"韵读总说","targetNotes":"全篇韵读总说。","sourceLabel":"第 155 页","sourceNotes":"书内页 155《谷风》起首。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0001-1","attributionLabel":"王力","sectionLabel":"韵读"}]},{"id":"0002","order":2,"total":2,"layer":"span","layerLabel":"诗句片段","targetText":"习习谷风，以阴以雨。黾勉同心，不宜有怒。采葑采菲，无以下体。德音莫违，及尔同死。行道迟迟，中心有违。不远伊迩，薄送我畿。谁谓荼苦，其甘如荠。宴尔新昏，如兄如弟。泾以渭浊，湜湜其沚。宴尔新昏，不我屑以。毋逝我梁，毋发我笱。我躬不阅，遑恤我后。就其深矣，方之舟之。就其浅矣，泳之游之。何有何亡，黾勉求之。凡民有丧，匍匐救之。不我能慉，反以我为雠。既阻我德，贾用不售。昔育恐育鞫，及尔颠覆。既生既育，比予于毒。我有旨蓄，亦以御冬。宴尔新昏，以我御穷。有洸有溃，既诒我肄。不念昔者，伊余来塈。","targetNotes":"全篇韵读。","sourceLabel":"第 155-156 页","sourceNotes":"依据页图 /tmp/035-gu-feng-wangli/p163.png 与 /tmp/035-gu-feng-wangli/p164.png；书内页 155-156 收《谷风》全篇韵读。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0002-1","attributionLabel":"王力","sectionLabel":"韵读"}]}]}}}
